    "content": "<style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><!--[if mso]><style>.button-table { padding: 12px 0 }</style><![endif]--><div><style>\n  .email {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 40px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:36px 36px 0px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Dear {{ subscriber.first_name }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">I hope this message finds you well and you are enjoying your holiday season. Thank you for your interest in our Financial Planning &amp; Analysis (FP&amp;A) course. We applaud you for showing interest in furthering your career and improving your FP&amp;A capabilities and would like to provide you with a special offer to assist with your learning goals.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">If you enroll in our next FP&amp;A course before January 1, 2024, you can take advantage of a discounted price of<strong> $499 USD.</strong> This limited-time offer represents a savings of $100 USD from the regular price of $599 USD.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Please note that many of our students submit the course for reimbursement to their employer.  <a href=\"vhttps://www.thefpandaguy.com/fpa-course\" trigger-id=\"4211696\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\"><strong>Click here</strong></a><strong> </strong>to go to the course page and download our reimbursement form for use with your employer.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Here&#x27;s what our FP&amp;A course has to offer:</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span>4 - 2 and a half hour Live Instructor-led virtual sessions</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Multiple analytical and visualization Excel files that can be used in daily work\t</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Free access to a bundle of two digital courses a $99 Value</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>A 30-minute consultation with the instructor after course completion, a $125.00 value</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>All sessions are recorded for later viewing</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>A 15-Minute conversation with an instructor prior to the course launch</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Participants will receive copies of all course materials and supplementary FP&amp;A resources</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Certificate of completion will be provided </span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Our students rave about the course. Please see recent testimonials below:</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">&quot;Taking this intense training course was a total game-changer! Huge shoutout to Paul and Ron for designing it like pros \u2013 packed with info but still loads of fun. These guys know their stuff, and the way they break things down is crystal clear. What I love about this course is they&#x27;ve thrown in cool breaks and activities. It&#x27;s not just a brain dump \u2013 they keep it interesting. Plus, Paul and Ron make you feel totally cool asking questions. No judgment zone.... The lectures were like a gift from above. I actually used some of the stuff right away for my clients.&quot;  </div><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">\u200b</div><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">     -  Andy Zhou</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">\u201cAmazing course! All 4 sessions added tremendous value to my role and team. They were all very relevant to not just F&amp;PA, but any Finance role. The visualizations really allowed me to understand how to display and share my story in a more understandable way (not just within finance). You both provided incredible tips, resources and examples that catered to everyone.&quot;       </div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">          - Jennifer Caron </div></div><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">To secure this special pricing, simply click the link and complete the registration process, and we will be in touch. </p><!--[if !mso]>--><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://buy.stripe.com/dR6aIGdcg4G6bx6dR2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"border-color:#00bf63;background-color:#00bf63;box-sizing:border-box;border-style:solid;color:#fbf6f6;display:inline-block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:16px;border-radius:10px 10px 10px 10px\" trigger-id=\"4211698\"><strong>Buy The Course Today</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table><!--<![endif]--><!--[if mso]><table class=\"button-table\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#00bf63\" style=\"background-color:#00bf63;overflow:hidden;padding:12px 20px\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://buy.stripe.com/dR6aIGdcg4G6bx6dR2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background-color:inherit;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;border-style:solid;margin:0;color:#fbf6f6;font-size:16px\" trigger-id=\"4211698\" data-ck-element=\"button\"><strong>Buy The Course Today</strong></a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><![endif]--><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Don&#x27;t miss this opportunity to enhance your skills and propel your career forward.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We look forward to having you as part of our FP&amp;A community. Should you have any questions or require further assistance, please do not hesitate to reach out either Ron (ron.monteiro18@gmail.com) or Paul (pbarnhurst@thefpandaguy.com).</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Thank you once again for your interest, and we can&#x27;t wait to see you grow your Financial Planning &amp; Analysis skill set!</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<br/>Warm regards,<br/>\u200b<br/>Paul Barnhurst</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">The FP&amp;A Guy<br/>\u200b<br/>Ron Monteiro<br/>The Storytelling guy</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]><br /><br /><![endif]--></div></center></div><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 0px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:18px 36px 18px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:520px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">{{ address }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">\u200b<a href=\"{{ unsubscribe_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Unsubscribe</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"{{ subscriber_preferences_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Preferences</a>\u200b</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table></center></div><div class=\"ck-section ck-hide-in-public-posts\" style=\"margin:30px auto 0px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=